HyperCeiler (https://github.com/ReChronoRain/HyperCeiler)
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
    Copyright (C) 2023-2026 HyperCeiler Contributions.

    Some hooks in this module are independent re-implementations of HyperCeiler
    rules, rewritten against this module's own hook API. The logic and target
    class/method names were taken from the following HyperCeiler sources:

      - DarkModeHooks.java
          from rules/systemframework/display/AllDarkMode.kt
          (itself derived from SetoHook by SetoSkins)
      - MessageHooks.java
          adapted from rules/mms/DisableAd.java, DisableRiskTip.java,
          ImOldDevice.java and AutoCopyVerificationCode.kt (upstream HyperStar);
          selected risk types are handled independently, numeric codes are marked
          sensitive and never logged or persisted
      - HomeHooks.java
          adapted from rules/home/DisablePrestart.java and title/HideReportText.java;
          installer-name override is restricted to the uninstall dialog call
      - LockscreenPinHooks.java
          adapted from rules/systemui/lockscreen/ScramblePIN.java;
          verified phone layout matrices and rollback for complete digit views
      - AppStoreHooks.java
          from rules/systemframework/others/BypassForceMiAppStore.java
      - ClipboardHooks.java
          from rules/systemframework/others/ClipboardWhitelist.java
      - GuardHooks.java
          from rules/guardprovider/DisableUploadAppListNew.java
      - PersistentUpdateHooks.java
          target names and install scoping from
          rules/systemframework/corepatch/DisablePersistent.java
          (adapted to libxposed 102 with per-thread, nested scopes)
      - SecurityExtraHooks.java (additional app details and Play Store action)
          from rules/securitycenter/app/AppDetails.java

    Further hooks in the developer's own base (Core Patch, Flag Secure, theme,
    updater and others) are likewise derived from HyperCeiler and its upstreams;
    see the per-file headers.

